{"title":"Slim Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim Artificial Christmas Trees Perfect for Smaller Spaces\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim artificial Christmas trees offer a space-saving solution for smaller areas, apartments, and tighter layouts, bringing the elegance of a traditional Christmas tree without overwhelming your space. At King of Christmas, our collection of slim and narrow Christmas trees is designed to deliver the same high-quality craftsmanship and festive charm as our \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/full-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Full Artificial Christmas Trees\" style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003efull-sized trees\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, all within a refined, narrow silhouette.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAvailable in a variety of heights and styles, from slim profiles to skinny pencil trees designed for the tightest spaces, our collection is ideal for apartments, entryways, corners, and smaller living rooms. Many styles are also available as pre-lit slim artificial Christmas trees, featuring professionally installed LED lights for a warm, evenly lit holiday display with minimal setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhy choose a slim artificial Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim Christmas trees are designed for spaces where a traditional tree may feel too large. Their narrow silhouette fits easily into corners, apartments, and smaller rooms while still providing ample space for \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\" title=\"Christmas Ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e and decorations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDespite their compact footprint, slim artificial Christmas trees maintain a polished, elegant appearance. Compared to full-sized Christmas trees, slim trees take up less floor space while still offering similar height and visual impact.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhere should I place a slim Christmas tree?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim and narrow Christmas trees are perfect for apartments, small living rooms, entryways, offices, and tight corners where space is limited. They also work well as secondary trees in bedrooms, dining rooms, or other areas where you want to add a festive touch without overwhelming the space.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat are the best-selling slim artificial Christmas trees?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eMany of our most popular full-sized trees are also available in slim versions. These slim Christmas trees feature the same realism and premium craftsmanship, while offering a narrower profile that fits comfortably in smaller spaces.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePopular options include the \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/alpine-fir\" title=\"Alpine Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eAlpine Fir\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/king-fraser-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003eKing Fraser Fir\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. For those who love a snow-covered look, our best-selling \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/queen-flock-artificial-christmas-tree\" title=\"Queen Flock Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQueen Flock\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e is also available in a slim version, delivering the same luxurious flocked branches and enchanting winter-inspired appearance in a more compact design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a skinny Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA skinny Christmas tree, also known as a pencil tree, is the narrowest style of artificial Christmas tree, designed for extremely tight spaces where even a standard slim tree may feel too wide. Skinny Christmas trees have an upright, column-like silhouette that works beautifully in narrow entryways, hallways, beside fireplaces, or in corners with very little floor space. Whether you are looking for a skinny Christmas tree with lights already professionally installed or an unlit version you can style yourself, our pencil trees are available to suit any holiday aesthetic. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003eAre slim artificial Christmas trees realistic?\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eKing of Christmas offers high-quality slim artificial Christmas trees designed with lifelike branch tips and natural evergreen shapes that closely resemble real trees. Even with a narrower profile, these trees maintain a full, balanced appearance that creates a realistic and elegant holiday display.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat size slim Christmas tree should I buy?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhen choosing a slim Christmas tree, consider both ceiling height and available floor space. Leaving 6–12 inches between the top of the tree and the ceiling allows room for a tree topper and ensures a good fit. If you still aren’t sure, taking the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/a\/p\/find-the-perfect-christmas-tree?instore=true#\/\" title=\"Find The Perfect Christmas Tree\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTree Quiz\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e will help you find the perfect size and style for your space!\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eAre slim Christmas trees good for apartments?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim artificial Christmas trees are a popular choice for apartments and smaller homes because their narrow silhouette fits comfortably into compact spaces while still creating a beautiful holiday centerpiece. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eSlim vs. Full Christmas Trees: Which Is Better?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eChoosing between a slim and full Christmas tree depends on your space and decorating preferences. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFull-sized trees offer a wider, more traditional silhouette that works well in larger rooms with ample space. Slim trees, on the other hand, provide a similar height and presence while taking up less floor space. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eFor apartments, corners, and compact living areas, slim trees provide the perfect balance of style and functionality.\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhether you’re decorating a small apartment or looking to add a tree to a secondary space, our slim artificial Christmas trees offer a versatile and space-saving design. Explore our collection to find a tree that fits your space beautifully while bringing the magic of the season into your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642901393472,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_e7d10a3a-8506-4193-a238-f2c4735477fb.jpg?v=1718158125"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901524544,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_d22f2bae-9586-452c-b63e-6bf6f63a60ad.jpg?v=1714673459"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642901655616,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4.jpg?v=1718158497"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642901917760,"sku":"KFS-T7.5-L","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_b2208eb9-116f-4bbb-8a55-3ac045ff327e.jpg?v=1714673454"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642902081600,"sku":"KFS-T9-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_f294daff-b7c9-4c98-a20e-3d3c08a07b0b.jpg?v=1718159089"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 900 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642902212672,"sku":"KFS-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_75ca9054-4438