 Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642903064640,"sku":"KFS-T12-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_3b633f57-a093-4cad-ad9d-b9ee49c0cf07.jpg?v=1714673451"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642924822592,"sku":"RFS-T6.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-6.jpg?v=1718158268"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642924953664,"sku":"RFS-T6.5-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Royal-Fir-Slim-v2_e8fb1dec-d959-441f-aec8-9a923eb82099.jpg?v=1722013081"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642925117504,"sku":"RFS-T7.5-U","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-6_46225455-1137-4c7a-b27b-b146f648d2c4.jpg?v=1718158772"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"7.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 650 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642925248576,"sku":"RFS-T7.5-L","price":849.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Royal-Fir-Slim-v2_a667ad96-2059-46b4-855c-d3dc9272b181.jpg?v=1722013079"},{"product_id":"9-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"9' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate yo